Note on bundled reference texts: files under `compliance/references/` are
provided for audit convenience. The GDPR text (CELEX 32016R0679) is an
official publication of the European Union; the ISO 27001 Annex A summary is
a third-party reference summary. These texts retain their original sources
and are not covered by the MIT license above beyond the act of bundling.
